<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Candle shares shine brightly on debut.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Candle shares shine brightly on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in information technology recruitment services provider, Candle Australia Ltd, made their debut on the Australian Stocks Exchange on Thursday at A$1.15, a 15 percent premium to their issue price of A$1.00 per share.  </p>
<p>The company raised A$13.8 million through the issue of 13.8 million shares, underwritten by stockbrokers Burdett, Buckeridge and Young.</p>
<p>New shareholders hold 56.33 percent of the issued capital, while existing shareholders retained 43.67 percent of the company.</p>
<p>By 11.10 a.m. (0110 GMT), Candle shares were at A$1.14, giving a market capitalisation of about A$27.9 million.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
